      "Among the least expensive underlayments with an integrated vapour barrier",
      "2mm thickness is appropriate for rigid core locking systems",
      "Adhesive overlap strip makes sealing seams straightforward",
      "Very light and easy to handle over a large area",
      "Large roll coverage keeps the total cost low on a whole-house job",
