    reviewCount: 2600,
    pros: [
      "Naturally antimicrobial and resistant to mould, which suits basements",
      "Excellent acoustic damping from a genuinely dense material",
      "Good thermal insulation over cold subfloors",
      "Renewable material harvested without felling trees",
      "Firm under load so it supports rather than cushions rigid planks",
